ラストも欲しいです。こちらは友人に配るステッカーなどに使いたいと思っています。\nこれに関しては不可能でしたら大丈夫です。\n\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lagoon_bluebear/works/59", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3be82333/uploads/origins/6047261d-9eba-4a2f-a9e5-f13b8cb55313?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8077ea6de013f0439c251001f5253f85", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3be82333/uploads/origins/6047261d-9eba-4a2f-a9e5-f13b8cb55313?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8077ea6de013f0439c251001f5253f85, https://si.imgix.net/3be82333/uploads/origins/6047261d-9eba-4a2f-a9e5-f13b8cb55313?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f32999f3c9455de00b94f2dd75204214 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3be82333/uploads/origins/6047261d-9eba-4a2f-a9e5-f13b8cb55313?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e0c0a096c91d842befb5e012f987684c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Lagoon_bluebear/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9634cd63/uploads/origins/34b48067-cd13-4988-8437-7dc96fa8cd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=02b721872bd899bba78e846792049d7f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9634cd63/uploads/origins/34b48067-cd13-4988-8437-7dc96fa8cd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalig